 "name": "Rosaleen Boswell"
 },
 "datePublished": "a month ago",
 "reviewBody": "Very happy!! Booked - Residential post construction cleaning done in Edmonton.  This was my first time booking this type of service for our home following a bigger reno project (new floors, baseboards/trim, walls painted).  We were very impressed with the cleaning. Two very experienced ladies came and did our 2100 square foot space in about 5.5 hours.  Duty Cleaners online portal also very easy to use (I added comments about areas to focus on, or what we didn\u2019t need/want done).  The amount of dust in our house was overwhelming - very glad to have this taken care of as every cabinet/wall/surface was covered.  Really easy to communicate with this company and that put my mind at ease.  Would definitely recommend.",
 "reviewRating": {
 "@type": "Rating",
