 "datePublished": "a week ago",
 "reviewBody": "Best cleaners out there in Edmonton. Fast efficient and friendly! Both from management and the cleaners were amazing and did excellent job. I highly recommend them for anyone\u2019s move-in/out clean. Thank you Duty cleaners! I appreciate your wonderful service!",
 "reviewRating": {
