 "@type": "Person",
 "name": "Jane Smith"
 },
 "datePublished": "3 months ago",
 "reviewBody": "The two cleaners arrived on time and did an great job cleaning. When I had forgotten to ask about cleaning the second fridge they checked on the price for be before starting. They did a great job on our move out clean including windows, spot washing the walls, appliances, floors, and bathrooms.\nI\u2019d definitely hire them again!",
 "reviewRating": {
 "@type": "Rating",
